data.value:
Amwe mumabendera mugerageza gutumiza yamaze gushyiraho indangagaciro. Urashaka kwandika hejuru yindangagaciro zabo hamwe nibisobanurwa mubitumizwa hanze?

Hano hari ibendera rya {0} rivuguruzanya:
{1}

JSON winjiye ntabwo bigaragara ko ifite agaciro. Nyamuneka reba kabiri hanyuma ugerageze.

Andi makuru:
{0}

Ububiko wahisemo kwinjizamo Voidstrap kugirango bubeho kandi ntabwo ari ubusa. Birasabwa cyane ko Voidstrap yinjizwa mububiko bwayo bwigenga.
Guhindura ahantu bikurikira birasabwa: {0}
Urashaka guhindura ahabigenewe? Guhitamo 'Oya' bizirengagiza iyi miburo hanyuma ukomeze kwishyiriraho.

Komeza mod ya Voidstrap "{0}"?

{1}

 Voidstrap uburyo bushobora guhindura uburyo Voidstrap ikora kandi igahindura igenamiterere ryayo. Gusa fungura uburyo wizeye.

Shyiramo "{0}" {1} na @{2}?

{3}

Voidstrap igenzura buri dosiye irwanya isomero mbere yo kuyishiraho, ikabaza mbere yo gufungura mod.

Ubu buryo busimbuza amadosiye ubundi buryo bushoboka nabwo busimbuza:

{0}

Uburyo bwo guhuzagurika bushobora gutuma Roblox isa cyangwa ikitwara nabi, ariko ibi ntibishobora guhanuka Voidstrap. Zimya imwe muri zo niba hari ikintu gisa nabi.
